Farey perfect-product obstruction scout (codex S143)
================================================================
Quotient declaration:
  fraction a/b -> product ab -> complete bipartite graph K_{a,b}
  preserves: reduced factor-pair incidence, Farey level b, K33 threshold
  destroys: graph isomorphism type, minor core identity, divisor lattice

